The pattern is "abba".
The source is "dog cat cat dog".
The pieces is split source by " ".
Keep a shared words as an empty list of text.
For each piece in pieces.
Place piece into words.

Keep a shared keys as an empty list of text.
Keep a shared values as an empty list of text.
Keep a shared seek as empty text.
Keep a shared found as 0.
Keep a shared used as 0.
Keep a shared same as 0.
Keep a shared letter as empty text.

To locate from spot (a whole number) with last (a whole number).
If spot is more than last, return.
If item spot of keys matches letter, set found to spot, return.
Locate from spot plus 1 with last.

To check from spot (a whole number).
If item spot of values does not match seek, set same to 0.

To search from spot (a whole number) with last (a whole number).
If spot is more than last, return.
If item spot of values matches seek, set used to 1, return.
Search from spot plus 1 with last.

The length is the number of characters in pattern.
The count is the number of items in words.
The good is 1.
If length is not count, set good to 0.
If length is count.
For every spot from 0 to 3.
The symbol is character spot of pattern.
Set letter to empty text.
Place symbol into letter.
Set seek to item spot of words.
Set found to -1.
The keylast is the last position of keys.
Locate from 0 with keylast.
Set same to 1.
If found is at least 0, check from found.
If found is at least 0 and same is 0, set good to 0.
If found is -1, set used to 0.
The valuelast is the last position of values.
If found is -1, search from 0 with valuelast.
If found is -1 and used is 1, set good to 0.
If found is -1 and used is 0, Place letter into keys, Place seek into values.

If good is 1, show true, otherwise show false.
